spice
* SPICE Netlist for the given circuit

V1 1 6 DC 0
R_b 1 3 r_b
R_e 6 3 r_e
R_mu 3 8 r_mu
R_o 8 4 r_o
I_gm 3 4 DC gmv1
C_mu 3 8 C_mu
C_pi 5 7 C_pi

* Nodes:
* 1 - Base
* 2 - Emitter
* 3 - Connection point of components (gmv1, r_mu, C_mu, C_pi, r_e)
* 4 - Collector
* 5-to-7 - Pathway for C_pi
* 6 - Positive terminal of V1
* 8 - Another connection point for r_mu and r_o

.END